  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the yakimono-grill to 400°F (200°C).",
    "Thread 4-6 pieces of salmon onto each bamboo skewer, leaving a little space between each piece.",
    "Brush the skewers with olive oil and season with smoked paprika.",
    "Thread a piece of nori seaweed sheet onto each skewer, pressing gently to adhere.",
    "Dip the sesame seeds in a little water and sprinkle over the seaweed sheet.",
    "Sprinkle garlic granules and grated ginger over the sesame seeds.",
    "Place the skewers on the preheated grill and cook for 8-10 minutes, or until golden brown.",
    "Remove from the grill and sprinkle with chopped scallions, lemon zest, and a pinch of brown rice flour.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!"
  ],
